# Benchmark & tree-shaking artifacts
#
# results.json holds wall-clock timings, so committing it would make every
# `pnpm bench` run show up as a dirty tree. The durable record of the numbers is
# docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-008, which is reviewed.
#
# The visualizer emits `stats-<entry>.html`, so the patterns are globs. They were
# `stats.html` / `stats.json` -- filenames vite.config.ts never produces -- and
# 342 kB of generated HTML got committed past them.
benchmarks/results.json
benchmarks/treeshake-fixture/dist/
benchmarks/treeshake-fixture/stats-*.html
benchmarks/treeshake-fixture/stats-*.json
